            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of superheroes. Kind of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the Geek Patrol went their separate ways, the former supergeeks find themselves back together at StrawPop, a multi-day pop culture convention full of old friends, old arguments, professional obligations, superhero nostalgia, and the practical inconvenience of having powers while trying to get through a weekend like a normal person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>five days </strong>and<strong> 70 scenes</strong>, you’ll make choices for <strong>14 characters</strong>, shaping how they deal with each other, what survives the reunion, and where each of them ends up when the convention is over. Every scene gives you multiple ways to respond, from dry understatement, to subdued comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Grosse Pointe Blank by way of American Graffiti. Kind of.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of superheroes. Kind of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the Geek Patrol went their separate ways, the former supergeeks find themselves back together at StrawPop, a multi-day pop culture convention full of old friends, old arguments, professional obligations, superhero nostalgia, and the practical inconvenience of having powers while trying to get through a weekend like a normal person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>five days </strong>and<strong> 70 scenes</strong>, you’ll make choices for <strong>14 characters</strong>, shaping how they deal with each other, what survives the reunion, and where each of them ends up when the convention is over. Every scene gives you multiple ways to respond, from dry understatement, to subdued comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Grosse Pointe Blank by way of American Graffiti. Kind of.</p>",
